AIM: Python program to Create a list and perform following methods: insert(), remove(), 
append(), len(),pop(), clear(). 
SOURCE CODE: 
 
numbers = [10, 20, 30] 
# append 
numbers.append(40) 
print("After append:", numbers) 
 
# insert 
numbers.insert(1, 15) 
print("After insert:", numbers) 
 
 
# remove 
numbers.remove(20) 
print("After remove:", numbers) 
 
 
# len 
print("Length of list:", len(numbers)) 
 
 
# pop 
numbers.pop() 
print("After pop:", numbers) 
 
 
# clear 
numbers.clear() 
print("After clear:", numbers)
